<title>THAILAND: Thai May balance of payment deficit 112.3 bln baht.</title>
<headline>Thai May balance of payment deficit 112.3 bln baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's balance of payments deficit widened to 112.3 billion in May from 15.5 billion in April, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
